  {
    "id": "mynatural",
    "title": "MyNatural – segmentation of young skincare customers (in-class case)",
    "text": [
      "MyNatural produces premium natural and organic skincare and plans a new line for young consumers. 1,276 customers answered an online survey. Attitudinal scores range from 1 (low) to 5 (high): GreenValues (attitude towards sustainability), Knowledge (about environmental issues), Evaluation (opinion of MyNatural products), ProductBeliefs (sustainable products are better than traditional ones), Social (influence of friends on sustainable choices). A k-means cluster analysis produced three clusters. * = statistically significantly different from the other clusters."
